              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
